  /// shown through NotReadyReason()
  note "The Gmail mailbox '{Address}' has no OAuth client yet — set ClientId and ClientSecret from your Google Cloud project." => "صندوق Gmail '{Address}' ليس له عميل OAuth بعد. اضبط ClientId وClientSecret من مشروعك على Google Cloud.";
  /// Osysharp.Mail.Gmail.GmailMailbox.NotReadyReason · note
